照搬的字段(保持原样,以便与 Kazumi 规则格式兼容、日后可直接导入更多规则):
api/type/name/version/muliSources/useWebview/useNativePlayer/usePost/useLegacyParser/userAgent/adBlocker/
referer/baseURL/searchURL/searchList/searchName/searchResult/chapterRoads/chapterResult/searchMode/chapterMode/
antiCrawlerConfig(各文件有哪些字段以对应的上游文件为准)。

